          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musafi Harunifi ilmaani isaa Waaro Woyyuma dura gara ilaboru qubatani. Hujiini worra aka Fulla Qulqullooti aada worra Israeliti tolchani. Nama d'ibi waan kanati d'iaatu inijeesani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henni nama d'iira ka gosa Lawi, ka haga d'alate jia toko oli, ka Musani dubbi AABBO Waaqa gula balbala worra gula t'aafe nama 22,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka worri Lawi fulla ilmaani angafa fud'ate",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
