              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan Musani jed'e, Ilmi angafa ka Israeli ch'ufti kiyya. Tanaafi ilma angafa ka Israeli, ka haga d'alate jia toko oli, ch'ufa, maqa worraa t'aafi. Ammo fulla worra suni anini waan jed'u, Gochiti Lawi ch'ufti tiyya! Anini AABBO Waaqa! Ammalle anini, waan jed'u, Looni gosa Lawi ch'ufti fulla waan looni Israeli goroomuma d'alani kiyya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.40+NUM.3.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.40",
              "NUM.3.41"
            ]
          }
